# Generated recompiled code (regenerate from XBE with the recomp pipeline).
# Two locations: our project's actual layout, and the toolkit's own default
# output dir when tools.recomp is run without --gen-dir from the toolkit
# root (build.ps1's intermediate copy source before it lands in src/recomp/gen/).
# Both are 1M+ lines mechanically derived from the copyrighted XBE - never commit.
src/recomp/gen/
recomp/gen/

# Game files (user must provide their own legally-owned copies)
game/
game_extracted/
*.xbe
*.iso
*.xiso

# Run/build logs (regenerated by run.bat / build.ps1)
